<section class="section" data-cms-section="workshop" data-cms-section-name="The workshop"><p class="section-label" data-cms-editable>01 / The workshop</p><div class="statement-grid"><h2 data-cms-editable>The photograph is made live, from exposure to positive.</h2><div class="statement-copy"><p data-cms-editable>This is not a prerecorded course and not a demonstration assembled after the fact. Exposure decisions, chemistry and the physical transformation of the film are presented live from the studio in Brazil.</p><p data-cms-editable>During the second session I make as many photographs as the time allows, deliberately changing exposure and processing parameters so the group can compare what each decision changes. The purpose is not to hand out a universal recipe, but to make the process understandable and controllable.</p></div></div></section>
